	'pre_b1_p1' => 'Batch 1 is limited to 300 panels, scheduled for installation between 6 April and 25 June 2027. Pre-orders close on 31 January 2027. To reserve a panel for your floor, send the pre-order enquiry below or email our pre-order desk directly. Please specify your organisation name, city, number of floors, approximate desk count per floor, and preferred install month. Élodie Marchand handles every pre-order enquiry personally from our Norrbridge office.',
	'pre_b2_p1' => 'Our pre-order process follows four straightforward stages. First, submit your pre-order form or email our desk. Within two working days, we confirm your build slot and survey date, requesting the EUR 200 deposit per panel. Second, your deposit remains fully refundable until your build slot is confirmed. Third, Daniel surveys your building floor two to three weeks prior to install day. Fourth, Priya\'s team completes installation in one day, with the remaining balance invoiced after the walk-through, payable in 30 days.',
	'pre_b3_p1' => 'Hardware and service prices are fixed in euros across all regions. The Zaseki Panel is EUR 1,480. Desk tags cost EUR 260 per pack of 20. Building installation is EUR 640. Additional panels installed in the same building on the same day are EUR 1,180 each. Remote floor-plan updates are EUR 90, and the optional care plan is EUR 180 per panel per year. All listed prices exclude VAT. Deposits are EUR 200 per panel.',
	'pre_b4_p1' => 'Our pre-order desk is open Monday to Friday, 09:00 to 17:30 Central European Time. You can submit your reservation details using the form on this page or email hello@zaseki-panel.example directly with the button below. Please mention your building location, floor numbers, and total desk counts. We reply to every pre-order enquiry within two working days with build slot availability and scheduled survey dates.',
