	'preorder_email_button' => 'Email your pre-order',
	'preorder_mail_subject' => 'Pre-order: Zaseki Panel batch 1',
	'preorder_note' => 'Tell us your building, floors and desks per floor. We reply within two working days.',
	'price_h' => 'One price per floor.',
	'price_label' => 'Price',
	'price_note' => 'Prices exclude VAT. EUR 200 deposit per panel, refundable until your build slot is confirmed.',
	'price_p' => 'Pre-orders are open for the first batch of 300 panels. One panel serves one floor of up to 120 desks, and every price below is what you pay: the install, the tags and the care plan are listed, not hidden in a quote.',
	'pricing_b1_p1' => 'The core Zaseki Panel costs EUR 1,480, covering one wall panel for up to 120 desks, mounting bracket, and 3 metre cable. Desk tags are EUR 260 per pack of 20, including adhesive pads and coin cells. Building install is EUR 640 for the survey visit, one install day, and the team walk-through. An additional floor panel in the same building installed on the same day is EUR 1,180. Remote floor-plan updates after a furniture re-layout are EUR 90. The optional care plan is EUR 180 per panel per year, covering spare parts, remote updates, and phone help. All prices exclude VAT. A deposit of EUR 200 per panel applies, refundable until your build slot is confirmed.',
	'pricing_b2_p1' => 'Pre-orders for our initial batch of 300 panels are open until 31 January 2027, with scheduled installation dates running between 6 April and 25 June 2027. Securing a panel requires a deposit of EUR 200 per panel, which is refundable in full until your build slot is confirmed. Once Priya\'s team finishes the installation and completes the twenty minute walk-through with your staff, we invoice the remaining balance, payable within 30 days.',
	'pricing_b3_p1' => 'For an independent coworking space or studio floor with 80 desks, the total setup cost is EUR 3,160. This includes one Zaseki Panel at EUR 1,480, four packs of 20 desk tags at EUR 260 each (EUR 1,040 total), and the comprehensive building install at EUR 640. Daniel surveys the floor in advance, Priya\'s team fits the tags and mounts the panel in one day, and your front desk receives the full operational walk-through before handover.',
	'pricing_b4_p1' => 'For a larger building operating across three floors with 240 desks, the complete installation costs EUR 7,600. This configuration includes one primary Zaseki Panel at EUR 1,480, two additional floor panels at EUR 1,180 each (EUR 2,360 total), twelve packs of desk tags at EUR 260 each (EUR 3,120 total), and building installation for EUR 640. All three floors are surveyed together and installed during the same scheduled visit.',
	'pricing_h1' => 'The price list',
	'pricing_h2' => 'Batch 1 dates and deposit terms',
