	'pricing_t2' => 'Where the money goes.',
	'privacy_b1_p1' => 'When you pre-order a panel, contact our desk, or join our waitlist, we collect your name, work email address, organisation name, building city, and layout specifications. We use this information solely to correspond regarding your build slot, schedule on-site surveys with Daniel Okafor, coordinate installation with Priya Raman, and invoice your account. We retain customer correspondence at our Norrbridge office only as long as necessary to provide service and maintain warranty records.',
	'privacy_b2_p1' => 'All customer communications sent to hello@zaseki-panel.example are processed securely by our pre-order desk. We do not use tracking scripts or share contact information with external marketing organisations. The physical Zaseki Panel and desk tags operate anonymously on local radio and Wi-Fi without tracking individual worker identities or recording personal attendance history. You may request the review, update, or deletion of your contact records at any time by contacting Élodie Marchand at our pre-order desk.',
	'privacy_h1' => 'Information we collect and how we use it',
	'privacy_h2' => 'Data storage and your rights',
	'privacy_l1' => 'Legal',
	'pt1_t' => 'The panel',
	'pt2_t' => 'Desk tags',
	'pt3_t' => 'Bracket and power',
	'pt4_t' => 'Floor plan',
	'q1_a' => 'Yes. The panel uses the local Wi-Fi to talk to the desk tags and to receive floor-plan updates. The survey checks the signal at the wall before anything is ordered.',
	'q1_q' => 'Does the panel need Wi-Fi?',
	'q2_a' => 'One panel shows up to 120 desks on one floor. For a bigger floor or another floor in the same building, an additional floor panel is installed on the same day.',
	'q2_q' => 'Can one panel cover more than 120 desks?',
	'q3_a' => 'No. Nobody installs or signs into anything. Anyone who can reach the lobby wall can tap a free desk and hold it.',
	'q3_q' => 'Do visitors need an account or an app?',
	'q4_a' => 'Send us the new layout and we redraw the floor plan and send it to the panel remotely. A floor-plan update is EUR 90.',
	'q4_q' => 'What if we re-arrange the floor?',
	'q5_a' => 'Yes. The EUR 200 deposit is refundable in full until your build slot is confirmed.',
	'q5_q' => 'Can we cancel the pre-order?',
	'q6_a' => 'Installs for batch 1 take place between 6 April and 25 June 2027, in the build-slot order we confirm after your pre-order.',
	'q6_q' => 'When will the panel arrive?',
	'q_h' => 'Before you pre-order.',
	'q_label' => 'Questions',
	'qgroup1' => 'The panel',
	'qgroup2' => 'Pre-order',
	'qgroup3' => 'Install',
	'qq1_a' => 'Yes, the Zaseki Panel requires a local Wi-Fi connection to communicate across the office floor and receive remote updates. During the initial building survey, Daniel tests network signal strength between the planned wall panel mounting point and desk areas. The desk tags communicate status changes through low-power radio, while the wall panel uses Wi-Fi to keep the floor plan synchronised. A reliable connection ensures hold commands and tag taps update without delay.',
	'qq1_q' => 'Is a Wi-Fi connection needed for the panel to operate?',
	'qq2_a' => 'Each individual Zaseki Panel supports up to 120 desks on a single floor plan layout. If your building floor accommodates more than 120 desks, or if your workplace spans multiple floors, you can install additional panels. Additional floor panels installed in the same building on the same day cost EUR 1,180 each. For multi-floor properties, mounting one panel per floor near the elevator or lobby entrance provides visitors with an immediate, uncluttered overview.',
	'qq2_q' => 'Can a single panel support more than 120 desks?',
	'qq3_a' => 'Yes, visitors and members never need to download an application, register an account, or scan a digital code. We intentionally designed the Zaseki Panel as physical, accessible hardware. Anyone entering the lobby can touch a free sage square on the wall panel to place a fifteen-minute hold on a desk. When they arrive at the desk, tapping the physical tag confirms occupancy. It works immediately for day guests, casual visitors, and permanent staff alike.',
	'qq3_q' => 'Can visitors use the panel without an account or application?',
	'qq4_a' => 'When you reconfigure workstations, add new furniture, or alter your floor layout, we redraw your floor plan remotely for a fixed fee of EUR 90. Simply send your updated architectural drawing or seating plan to our pre-order desk. We redraw the vector map to reflect the new layout and transmit the update directly to your panel over Wi-Fi, eliminating the need for an on-site service visit or hardware modification.',
	'qq4_q' => 'What happens if we rearrange the office layout?',
	'qq5_a' => 'Yes, the EUR 200 deposit per panel is refundable in full until your build slot is confirmed. When you submit your pre-order, Élodie Marchand provides an estimated survey window and build schedule. If your building plans change or you decide not to proceed before your manufacturing slot is locked in, notify us by email and we will return your deposit promptly without cancellation fees.',
	'qq5_q' => 'Can we cancel our pre-order and receive our deposit back?',
	'qq6_a' => 'Pre-orders for our initial batch of 300 panels close on 31 January 2027. All batch 1 installations will take place between 6 April and 25 June 2027. Two to three weeks before your scheduled installation date, Daniel visits your building to complete the preliminary survey. Priya and her team then carry out the complete physical mounting, tag placement, and twenty minute staff walk-through on your assigned install day.',
	'qq6_q' => 'When will our panel arrive and be installed?',
