	'strip' => 'Batch 1 pre-orders close 31 January 2027',
	'terms_b1_p1' => 'Pre-ordering a Zaseki Panel requires a deposit of EUR 200 per panel. This deposit is refundable in full upon written request until your build slot is confirmed by our pre-order desk. Batch 1 is limited to 300 panels with pre-orders closing on 31 January 2027. Following installation and completion of the staff walk-through, Zaseki Panel invoices the remaining balance, which is payable within 30 days. All prices exclude VAT.',
	'terms_b2_p1' => 'Batch 1 installations are scheduled to take place between 6 April and 25 June 2027. Daniel surveys each building two to three weeks prior to the agreed installation date. Regarding hardware reliability, our sole warranty commitment is to repair or replace parts for 24 months from the installation date. Client buildings must ensure that wall mounting locations, power sockets, and local Wi-Fi coverage meet specified requirements prior to installation day.',
	'terms_h' => 'Terms',
