	'thanks_b1_p1' => 'We\'ll reply within two working days from our pre-order desk in Norrbridge. Élodie Marchand reviews every incoming request against our production schedule for batch 1. Her reply will confirm availability for your requested floor count, provide an estimated build slot between 6 April and 25 June 2027, and explain how to submit the refundable EUR 200 deposit per panel to secure your reservation.',
	'thanks_b2_p1' => 'While awaiting our reply, you can review your building readiness. Daniel will contact you two to three weeks before the installation date to arrange the preliminary survey visit. Please ensure your facilities team has identified wall locations with an available power socket within three metres. If you need to make immediate changes to your enquiry, email hello@zaseki-panel.example during desk hours, Monday to Friday from 09:00 to 17:30 Central European Time.',
	'thanks_back' => 'Back to the home page',
