	'wait_b1_p1' => 'Our first production run of 300 panels covers installations from 6 April through 25 June 2027, with pre-orders closing on 31 January 2027. If you are planning an office relocation, workspace refurbishment, or new building opening later in the year, joining our waitlist ensures you hear about batch 2 build slots before public allocation opens. We notify waitlist subscribers as soon as manufacturing capacity is scheduled at our Norrbridge workshop.',
	'wait_b2_p1' => 'Subscribers to our waitlist receive practical production updates and advance notice of future survey booking windows. We maintain a strict policy of sending at most one email each month. We never share subscriber contact details, nor do we send marketing promotions. When batch 2 pre-orders open, waitlist members receive direct links to reserve build slots and schedule preliminary floor surveys with Daniel Okafor before general release.',
